From: SaaiOS <os@saaios>
Subject: synaptics td4150: since36 0x40 waits STATUS_OK not leftover 0x1b

since35 sent GET_ROMBOOT_INFO 0x40 after 0x42 IDENTIFY timeout, but
completed that waiter on leftover REPORT_STATUS 0x1b. dispatch_report
does not copy a command payload, so 0x40 returned in ~377us with no
retval/version log (plen=0). Stock identify(false) in RomBoot waits
STATUS_OK / dispatch_response, same as other commands.

Stock syna_tcm_dispatch_message: code >= REPORT_IDENTIFY (0x10) is a
report. 0x1b never completes 0x40 or 0x42. 0x45 on this IC is the
exception (HDL ack). firmware_status 10 00 is hdl_version=2, all
need_*=0 — not a misnamed need_* bit; stock does not send 0x30.

Unpatched 0x45 header: 14 reserved bytes, [0]=size>>16, [1..13]=0,
then ROMBOOT_APP_CODE. No CRC appended after APP_CODE.

since36:
- 0x40: gpio=0 disable_irq, send, enable_irq. Wait STATUS_OK only.
  Clock leftover ATTN in process context (same as 0x42 IDENTIFY wait).
  Log 0x40 retval= plen= payload= mode= gpio=. Parse romboot_info.
- Do not complete 0x40 on leftover 0x1b. Keep 0x45 0x1b-complete.
- 0x1b bitfield audit once. No 0x30, no 0x14, no retry 97k.

Applies after syna-tcm-romboot-fw-areas-0x40.patch.

